  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Place peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the pumpkin between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649aa3412897e41b2e1e0617-5be2b7f4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, remove centre veins from makrut lime leaves, then very finely chop.\n• Trim and roughly chop pea pods.\n• In a small bowl, combine makrut leaves, mixed sesame seeds, sweet chilli sauce, ginger paste, the water and the soy sauce. TIP: The makrut leaves are fibrous so make sure to cut them very thin.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649aa3412897e41b2e1e0617-e3df40a0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, pat firm tofu (see ingredients) dry, then cut into 1cm pieces.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cornflour and a generous pinch of salt and pepper. Add tofu, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649aa3412897e41b2e1e0617-bd9a1478.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When pumpkin has 5 minutes remaining, place a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, shake excess cornflour off tofu, then cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes. In the last minute of cook time, add sweet chilli mixture and cook until bubbling, 30 seconds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649aa3412897e41b2e1e0617-898a130d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine shredded wombok, baby spinach leaves, pea pods, pumpkin, sesame dressing and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649aa3412897e41b2e1e0617-bcea1194.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide salad between bowls.\n• Top with golden sweet chilli-makrut tofu.\n• Sprinkle with crunchy fried noodles to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649aa3412897e41b2e1e0617-5c6f9b73.jpeg"
    }
  ]
